    "reviews": "\u201cIt is a seemingly simple game that has a lot of depth and complexity.\u201d<br>NeoRider7<br><br>\u201cEven if it's still in Early Access it has enough content to keep you going for hours... Especially at this price it is a sure recommendation and you'll get a lot of fun from it if you like puzzles!\u201d<br>LuckyStrike1305<br><br>\u201cIt's a great little puzzle programming card game!\u201d<br>smattymatty\u00a0<br>",
